Subject: [PATCH 03334/11362] [outer-loop] arc: exploration-to-first-win
 BASELINE -- undirected explorer reaches first-win 1/11 (the 0.08 wall,
 measured)

Ran the explorer policy (the unseen-game sim: no banked solution/adapter/internal-state reads) on
the offline arcade, 2000-action/game cap. First-win on 1/11 games (lp85, 20 actions); the other 10
burned ~2000 actions each and never triggered a single level-up (L+0, eff 0.0, GAVE-UP). r11l L1 is
4 actions WITH a recipe (exp3946) but 0 in 1956 first-contact -- the gap is directed exploration,
not reachability. This 1/11 undirected first-win rate IS the 0.08 wall, now measured, and is the
baseline the goal-biased online explorer must beat to justify spending a scarce L4x4 shot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
